Subject: CB policy-only stable ST2084 FP32 emission, default off

Matched renderer/shader/dispatch ABI required. Existing defaults and equations
remain unchanged. The inverse uses a bounded general expm1 primitive seed,
not a fitted transfer curve or an extra pass.

